From: Gregory Williams <gregory.williams@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 20 Aug 2025 16:53:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 058/190] misc: xilinx-ai-engine: Add support to set dma buffer
 descriptor

commit 3c58076f1beabb47652bae6a6cd7b64f66dc20a0 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Adds support to set buffer descriptor valid and length fields. Adds call
to write buffer descriptor from a given dmabuf and push this buffer
descriptor to the DMA task queue.

Signed-off-by: Gregory Williams <gregory.williams@amd.com>
Acked-by: Govindarajulu Varadarajan <govindarajulu.varadarajan@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250820235329.500334-6-gregory.williams@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
